# Adlaire-Design Generic Component Catalog

This catalog governs reusable public UI, content UI, form UI, layout UI, utility UI, and Git Provider UI.

`Docs/Master_Spec` is the higher-level source of truth.

## Scope

| Owns | Does not own |
| --- | --- |
| Generic public UI components | Admin-only UI |
| Content and documentation UI | WYSIWYG Editor UI |
| Form UI | Official SVG icon files |
| Layout UI | Brand asset files |
| Git Provider UI | Editor runtime internals |

## Implementation Targets

| Target | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `UI/components.css` | Reusable public components and Admin-shared surfaces. |
| `UI/components.js` | Component behavior. |
| `UI/content.css` | Content and documentation UI. |
| `UI/content.js` | Content behavior. |
| `UI/forms.css` | Form UI. |
| `UI/forms.js` | Form behavior. |
| `UI/grid.css` | Grid and section layout. |
| `UI/layout.css` | Page, app shell, and split pane layout. |
| `UI/utilities.css` | Small utilities. |
| `Tokens/` | Shared values only when they serve multiple components. |

## Implemented Groups

| Group | Examples | State |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Surface UI | card, panel, well, surface grid, surface item | 実装済み |
| Action UI | action row, button group, toolbar, CTA | 実装済み |
| State UI | badge, chip, status pill, status dot, empty/error/loading states | 実装済み |
| Content UI | notes, alerts, tables, FAQ, code, markdown-like surfaces | 実装済み |
| Form UI | input groups, composite inputs, date/time/period inputs, validation UI | 実装済み |
| Layout UI | core layout, meaningful grid, app shell, split pane, responsive policy | 実装済み |
| Navigation UI | tabs, breadcrumbs, pagination, command palette, global search | 実装済み |
| Data UI | KPI, metrics, charts, comparison, timeline | 実装済み |
| Git Provider UI | repository card, PR/Issue, diff, review, CI/CD, settings, mobile tabs | 実装済み |
| Accessibility UI | skip link, focus ring, landmark label, screen-reader helpers | 実装済み |

